{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00648",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 8.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "Hiya. I've, er, I've got a mole on my back that my sister says looks different."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.46,
      "end_seconds": 14.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Right. Tell me about it, what's changed?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.26,
      "end_seconds": 29.58,
      "duration_seconds": 14.32,
      "text": "Well, I can't see it myself, my sister spotted it at the swimming baths. She says it's bigger and a bit darker than it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.42,
      "end_seconds": 35.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Has anything changed that you've noticed, itching, bleeding, crusting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.34,
      "end_seconds": 48.37,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "It does itch a bit, now I think about it. Only recently, the last two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.39,
      "end_seconds": 53.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "When did your sister first notice the change?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.74,
      "end_seconds": 63.47,
      "duration_seconds": 8.73,
      "text": "She said it was a few months back she first noticed, but I'd not taken any notice."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.98,
      "end_seconds": 72.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "text": "Is it the only one, or are there others you're concerned about? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.61,
      "end_seconds": 81.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Just that one. I've got loads of freckles, but nothing else looks like it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.0,
      "end_seconds": 89.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Okay. Have you any skin conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.58,
      "end_seconds": 97.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "I had eczema as a kid, behind my knees. Not now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.96,
      "end_seconds": 105.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Right. Let me look. Can you take your top off, and turn around? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.81,
      "end_seconds": 113.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Er, yes. Sorry, it's a bit cold in here. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.19,
      "end_seconds": 136.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "It's fine. Just let me find the one you mean."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.35,
      "end_seconds": 144.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "It's low down on the left, near my waist. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.97,
      "end_seconds": 164.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "Yes, I see it. I'm going to use this dermatoscope, it's a magnifier with a light."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.16,
      "end_seconds": 167.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Is it painful? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.88,
      "end_seconds": 175.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Not at all. It just sits on the skin. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.53,
      "end_seconds": 177.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.74,
      "end_seconds": 192.8,
      "duration_seconds": 12.06,
      "text": "Right. It's about seven millimetres across and the colour isn't even, there's a darker area at one edge, and the border's slightly irregular. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.42,
      "end_seconds": 197.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Is that bad? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.99,
      "end_seconds": 215.18,
      "duration_seconds": 16.19,
      "text": "Those are the features we pay attention to. Most moles like this turn out to be harmless, I'd say this is likely a benign mole, but because it has changed and itches, I can't be certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.54,
      "end_seconds": 220.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "So what happens now? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.8,
      "end_seconds": 233.88,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "I'd like to take a dermoscopy photograph of it today, and send it to the skin specialists so they can look at it properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.98,
      "end_seconds": 238.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Will they cut it out? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.48,
      "end_seconds": 252.68,
      "duration_seconds": 11.2,
      "text": "They may want to take it off, to be safe, and then look at it under a microscope. They'll decide. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.4,
      "end_seconds": 256.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Oh. Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.51,
      "end_seconds": 265.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "It's a minor procedure with a local anaesthetic, and you'd be home the same day. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.21,
      "end_seconds": 270.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I'm a bit worried now. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.26,
      "end_seconds": 282.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.78,
      "text": "It's normal to be worried, but I'd rather we look at it now than wait. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.04,
      "end_seconds": 287.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "When will I hear? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.54,
      "end_seconds": 300.55,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "Within two weeks, you'll get a letter. If it changes again, bleeds, or you haven't heard in two weeks, ring us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.61,
      "end_seconds": 305.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I will. Thanks very much. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.3,
      "end_seconds": 308.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Take care. ~"
    }
  ]
}
